       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RDCICSHANDLER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TARGET-PGM PIC X(8).
       01 REC PIC X(8).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
       EXEC CICS HANDLE CONDITION ERROR(ERR-PARA) END-EXEC.
       MOVE 'NORMAL' TO TARGET-PGM.
       EXEC CICS READ FILE('INPUTDD') INTO(REC) END-EXEC.
       CALL TARGET-PGM.
       GOBACK.
       ERR-PARA.
       MOVE 'HANDLER' TO TARGET-PGM.
       CALL TARGET-PGM.
       GOBACK.
